    "title": "Did Patrick Muldoon Have a Wife? Find Out if the Actor Was Married",
    "text": "Image Credit: Alberto E. Rodriguez Co-stars pay tribute to Patrick Muldoon following sudden death Patrick Muldoon‘s death shocked fans, colleagues and his inner circle. The late actor, best known for playing the character Austin Reed in Days of Our Lives, died in April 2026 following a reported heart attack. He was 57, and fans are curious if he is survived by any family. So, was Patrick married? The San Pedro, California, native’s death came suddenly. Just two days beforehand, Patrick had shared an Instagram post about an upcoming project he was excited about. “So excited to be a part of this amazing project KOCKROACH directed by Matt Ross starring Chris Hemsworth, Taron Edgerton, Zazzie Beetz And Alec Baldwin. Filming now in Australia,” Patrick captioned the post. Learn about Patrick’s personal life here. No. Patrick was not married at the time of his death. He was dating his partner, Miriam Rothbart. How Long Were Patrick Muldoon & Miriam Rothbart Together? Patrick and Miriam started dating sometime in 2023. TMZ reported that Miriam was by his side when he died and called paramedics. Did Patrick Muldoon Ever Have a Wife? No, Patrick was never married. He was previously romantically linked to Denise Richards in the late 1990s, but their romance eventually fizzled out. They remained friends, though, since they worked together on several projects, including Starship Troopers and Dirty Hands, which came out last year. They also filmed a music video together for his song “Gray Again.” Though fans wanted to believe Patrick and Denise still had feelings for each other, he recently denied that assumption in an interview on Tori Spelling‘s “misSPELLING” podcast in late 2025. “The thing about Denise and I is everybody thinks we met on Starship Troopers, but we met in acting class when she was 19 and I was 21,” Patrick revealed. “We both don’t come from entertainment families, and our families got to know each other over the years and kind of checked in with each other on navigating the crazy stuff that we all go through.” After acknowledging that they dated “on and off in the ’90s,” Patrick pointed out that he and Denise were “very tight buddies, and she’s going through a rough spot right now with everything. I wish her the best for sure, and we’re friends.” Did Patrick Muldoon Have Children? No, Patrick did not have any children of his own.",
